  "upstream_build": "Dockerfile: clone michaelwillis/dragonfly-reverb tag 3.2.10 (+submodules), make -C plugins/dragonfly-hall-reverb (DSP objects only used), g++ -O2 -fPIC -std=c++14 hall_plugin.cpp -I plugin dir -I common -I dpf/distrho, link with DSP.cpp.o common/freeverb/*.cpp.o common/kiss_fft/*.o; release.yml: dist/dragonfly-hall/{dragonfly-hall.so,module.json} (src/ui.js is NOT shipped)",
  "wasm_notes": "Upstream compiles hall_plugin.cpp without -DLIBFV3_FLOAT while DSP.cpp/freeverb get it; here every TU gets LIBFV3_FLOAT so the fv3 types in DSP.hpp have one layout."
